// MISSING-SECOND: requires a second !tla.vector result
// SECOND-TYPE: load_dist dintlv_b8 requires matching vector result types
// EXTRA-SECOND: second result is only valid as !tla.vector
// UNALIGNED: load_dist requires aligned UB access
// BLOCK-STRIDE: block_stride is mutually exclusive with load_dist
// MASK: mask load only supports load_dist norm|us|ds

// BEGIN_MISSING_SECOND
